<section class="games-footer">
  <h2>Why games?</h2>
  <p>The practice surface is great for deliberate work — settle in, type a quote, watch your accuracy climb. Games solve a different problem: <strong>sustained engagement</strong>. They keep you typing when you're tired or bored, and they bend the practice toward weaknesses you'd otherwise avoid (the falling-word picker is weighted by your miss count).</p>
  <p>If you have an idea for a game you'd play, <a href="/contribute/">send a suggestion</a>.</p>
</section>
